{"id":"vod_bf_96423","vodId":"96423","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"薰香花朵凛然绽放","name_cn":"薰香花朵凛然绽放","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20250710-1/6fa64b3308a086448805f9f3a0be3a1c.jpg"},"summary":"家里开蛋糕店的凛太郎，因为高大的体型与凶狠的外表，从他小时候周围的人都对他抱有严重的偏见。某天，帮忙顾店的凛太郎与现场唯一的客人•薰子相遇了。娇小的她面前却有许多盘吃完的蛋糕，薰子一看见他就立刻逃离店里，凛太郎以为是因为自己的外表又吓到别人，不禁感到失落又自责。隔天放学后，他在自己的学校校门口看见薰子在等人……？相邻彼此、校风迥异的两间高中•千鸟与桔梗，分别就读于这两间学校的凛太郎与薰子，交织出酸甜又多彩的青春物语。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-09-28 10:50:58","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.fengbao8.com/video/xunxianghuaduolinranzhanfang/第13集/index.m3u8